flowchart LR
    User([User / Listener])
    Interface[Music App Interface]
    Collector[Input Collector]
    Profile[(User Taste Profile)]
    SongCatalog[(Song Catalog)]
    Agent[Agent - MusicRecommender]
    Retriever[Retriever - SongRetriever]
    VoyageAPI[[Voyage AI Embeddings API]]
    RetrievalEvaluator{Retrieval Reliability Evaluator}
    ClaudeAPI[[Claude API - Explanation Generation]]
    ExplanationEvaluator{Explanation Reliability Evaluator}
    Output[Ranked Recommendations with Explanations]
    Feedback[User Feedback Loop]
    Tester[[Automated Tester - pytest suite]]

    User -->|1 describes taste| Interface
    Interface --> Collector
    Collector --> Profile

    Profile -->|2 taste profile| Agent
    SongCatalog -->|3 song catalog| Agent
    Agent -->|4 delegates retrieval| Retriever
    Retriever <-->|5 embed profile and songs| VoyageAPI
    VoyageAPI --> RetrievalEvaluator
    RetrievalEvaluator -->|embeddings ok, use hybrid scoring| Retriever
    RetrievalEvaluator -.->|embeddings fail, fall back to tag matching only| Retriever
    Retriever -->|6 retrieved evidence and semantic scores| Agent

    Agent -->|7 evidence plus profile| ClaudeAPI
    ClaudeAPI --> ExplanationEvaluator
    ExplanationEvaluator -->|generation ok, use AI explanation| Agent
    ExplanationEvaluator -.->|generation fails or refuses, fall back to template| Agent

    Agent -->|8 ranked list with explanations| Output
    Output --> Interface
    Interface -->|9 shows results| User

    User -->|10 accepts or refines taste| Feedback
    Feedback --> Profile

    Tester -.->|verifies before merge| Retriever
    Tester -.->|verifies before merge| Agent

    subgraph Pipeline [Retrieval and Generation Pipeline]
        Agent
        Retriever
        VoyageAPI
        RetrievalEvaluator
        ClaudeAPI
        ExplanationEvaluator
    end

    subgraph HumanLoop [Human Checkpoint - Runtime]
        User
        Feedback
    end

    subgraph TestLoop [Automated Testing - Dev Time]
        Tester
    end
